1
00:00:04,390 --> 00:00:06,540
-你干吗呢 -嘘
- What are you doing? - Shh.

2
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:08,600
有个烟雾警报器在叫
One of the smoke alarms is chirping.

3
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,020
我得找出来是哪个
I'm trying to figure out which one it is

4
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:11,120
这样我才能把电池换了
so I can change the battery.

5
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:15,000
找吧 这活非你莫属了
Well, if anybody can find it it's you.

6
00:00:16,457 --> 00:00:18,136
你声音都变了
You s-sound horrible.

7
00:00:18,777 --> 00:00:20,515
你为什么不 为什么不再去躺会呢
Why don't...why don't you go back to bed?

8
00:00:21,156 --> 00:00:21,899
还有好多事儿没做呢
'Cause I've got too much to do.

9
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:24,760
我要做糕饼义卖会的手指饼
I've got to make the ladyfingers for the bake sale,

10
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:26,040
还要去下健身房
and I've got to go by the gym --

11
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,320
我昨天把手机落在那了
I left my phone there yesterday.

12
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:28,260
都交给我吧
I'll do all that.

13
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:29,340
要互相依靠嘛
We're a team.

14
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:32,160
累的时候 总要有个肩膀可以依靠
When one of us is weak, we lean on the other.

15
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:33,680
亲爱的 你不用为我做这些的
Honey, you don't have to do that stuff.

16
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:35,880
宝贝 你为我做了这么多
Honey, with all you do for me,

17
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:38,040
包括一周要去四次健身房
including going to the gym four times a week

18
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:40,740
让我对你的身体性趣昂然 今天就交给我吧
to keep me interested, I got this.

19
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:42,720
你今天不是要带人家看房子吗
Don't you have houses to show today?

20
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:44,580
他们 不来了
They...canceled.

21
00:00:44,936 --> 00:00:46,124
别丧气啊 小可爱
Ohh, pumpkin.

22
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:47,400
说什么呢你
Are you kidding me?

23
00:00:47,639 --> 00:00:48,101
这可是 交了好运了
It's...lucky.

24
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:50,520
这样我正好能在家好好照顾你啊
This way I get to stay here and take care of you.

25
00:00:50,760 --> 00:00:51,200
好吧
Okay.

26
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:55,100
早啊
Hey!

27
00:00:55,159 --> 00:00:57,087
你们好 邓菲先生 邓菲太太
Hey, Mr. and Mrs. Dunphy.

28
00:00:57,146 --> 00:00:58,261
-你好 -海莉可以去上学了吗
- Hey. - Is Haley ready for school?

29
00:00:58,320 --> 00:00:59,280
她快下来了
She's on her way down.

30
00:00:59,340 --> 00:01:00,860
离我老婆远点
Don't get too close to my wife.

31
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:02,220
海莉告诉你们了吗
Haley told you about that?

32
00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:03,380
那只是个下流梦罢了
It's just a dream.

33
00:01:03,940 --> 00:01:04,680
天啊
Oh, god.

34
00:01:06,140 --> 00:01:07,480
是了 是厨房那个在响
Okay, that came from the kitchen.

35
00:01:07,671 --> 00:01:08,869
我怎么觉得是这里的
I-I thought it was in here.

36
00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:09,360
你确定吗
Really?

37
00:01:09,780 --> 00:01:11,736
你站在这听
Okay, you wait in here and listen for it.

38
00:01:11,736 --> 00:01:12,860
我去厨房
I'm gonna wait in there.

39
00:01:12,860 --> 00:01:14,420
至少我还能帮点小忙
I mean, it's the least I can do...

40
00:01:14,643 --> 00:01:16,765
自从 你懂的
after...Well, you know.

41
00:01:17,220 --> 00:01:18,320
我跟你一起去
I'm coming with you.

42
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:25,280
神啊 我真希望海莉能换个对象
Boy, I wish Haley would date some other boys.

43
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:27,320
你说什么 罗宾森[迪兰的姓]太太
What's that you say, Mrs. Robinson?

44
00:01:27,860 --> 00:01:28,300
别闹了
Don't.

45
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:30,680
我只是觉得她
I just feel like she owes it to herself

46
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:32,120
不应该在一颗树上吊死
to see what else is out there.

47
00:01:32,240 --> 00:01:34,038
迪兰天天在这里晃来晃去的
The way that Dylan's always hanging around here,

48
00:01:34,038 --> 00:01:35,460
说不定一等海莉到结婚年龄
he's probably gonna try to marry her

49
00:01:35,460 --> 00:01:36,960
他就想娶她了
the second she turns 18.

50
00:01:37,260 --> 00:01:38,120
你怎么知道他们不配呢
Hey, you never know.

51
00:01:38,192 --> 00:01:40,191
说不定他们是天造地设的一对呢
Maybe those two were meant to be together...

52
00:01:40,780 --> 00:01:41,640
就像我们一样
like we were.

53
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:44,800
亲爱的 他们怎么能和我们比
Honey, Haley and Dylan are not us.

54
00:01:47,340 --> 00:01:49,700
不 我觉得这个价格可以接受
No, I think that amount will be fine.

55
00:01:49,980 --> 00:01:51,820
你们选了莉莉我都高兴疯了
I'm just happy you want Lily.

56
00:01:52,734 --> 00:01:55,396
你们肯定会对她满意的
I-I think you're gonna be very happy with her.

57
00:01:55,838 --> 00:01:57,575
就这样
Okay. Oh!

58
00:01:57,780 --> 00:01:59,160
小卡 你不是把女儿给卖了吧
Cam? Did you just sell our baby?

59
00:01:59,320 --> 00:02:01,140
没 但是你还记得那个上次那个
No, but do you remember that agent we met

60
00:02:01,140 --> 00:02:02,540
给童星做代理的经纪人吗
that represents child actors,

61
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:04,680
就是那个说莉莉很有天赋
the one who said Lily might have what it takes

62
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:05,660
还给了我们名片的人?
and gave us his card?

63
00:02:05,864 --> 00:02:06,636
不是被我扔了吗
Yeah, that I threw away.

64
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:08,860
我又捡回来了
That I fished out of the trash?

65
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:12,560
刚才就是他打电话
That was him on the phone they're shooting

66
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:14,940
说有个儿童家具的广告
a children's-furniture-store commercial today,

67
00:02:14,940 --> 00:02:16,240
他们想让莉莉去拍!
and they want Lily!

68
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:18,120
我不是无缘无故把那张名片丢掉的
Look, I threw away that card for a reason.

69
00:02:18,320 --> 00:02:19,920
拜托 会很好玩的
Come on, it'll be fun,

70
00:02:19,920 --> 00:02:21,660
不但莉莉能出镜
and Lily will be on TV,

71
00:02:21,660 --> 00:02:23,780
我们还能为她上大学存笔钱哪
and we can put the money in her college account.

72
00:02:23,780 --> 00:02:25,900
我不要 我只想让我们的女儿
No, let's just let our daughter

73
00:02:25,900 --> 00:02:27,180
有个正常的童年
have a normal childhood, huh?

74
00:02:27,260 --> 00:02:29,380
晚了 莉莉已经上了基船了
I think that gay cruise has sailed.

75
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,460
只是一个广告而已嘛
It's just one commercial.

76
00:02:31,740 --> 00:02:33,040
我不同意
I don't like it.

77
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:34,200
不行 绝对不行
No. No.

78
00:02:35,260 --> 00:02:36,500
什么意思你
Oh, what, so that's it?

79
00:02:37,140 --> 00:02:38,720
现在成了你说了算了
You're the parent with the final say?

80
00:02:38,900 --> 00:02:40,220
凭什么 你不就赚两个臭钱吗
Why is that? Because you make the money?

81
00:02:40,320 --> 00:02:42,160
你知道我不是那个意思的
It's not about that, and you know it.

82
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:44,240
我也没指望你能理解我们
I wouldn't expect you to understand us.

83
00:02:44,260 --> 00:02:45,140
你一看就没明星范儿
You're not theater folk.

84
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:46,000
你也没
Neither are you.

85
00:02:46,332 --> 00:02:46,599
你不就是有年夏天
You did "Godspell"

86
00:02:46,940 --> 00:02:47,880
在谷仓里演过《上帝之语》嘛
one summer in a barn.

87
00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:48,880
你顶多是个民间艺人
You're barn folk.

88
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:51,540
莉莉 要习惯被嫉妒
Get used to that jealousy, Lily.

89
00:02:51,540 --> 00:02:53,540
燕雀安知鸿鹄之志哉
Ordinary people just don't understand us.

90
00:02:55,238 --> 00:02:56,648
丹尼斯 速至终端收发站
Dennis to shipping and receiving.

91
00:02:56,648 --> 00:02:58,180
丹尼斯 速至终端收发站
Dennis to shipping and receiving.

92
00:02:58,180 --> 00:02:59,140
好啊 杰克
Hola, Jack.

93
00:02:59,540 --> 00:03:00,960
嘿 你们怎么到这儿来了
Hey! What are you guys doing here?

94
00:03:01,220 --> 00:03:02,700
曼尼约了看医生
Manny had a doctor's appointment,

95
00:03:02,700 --> 00:03:05,000
所以我们过来找杰一起吃午饭 他在吗
so we're gonna catch lunch with Jay -- is he there?

96
00:03:05,066 --> 00:03:06,774
-在 他在里面 -好的
- Yeah, he's in back. - Okay.

97
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:07,620
你好啊 杰克逊
Good day, Jackson.

98
00:03:07,900 --> 00:03:08,700
你好啊 曼纽尔
Good day, Manuel.

99
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:10,200
你还在开叉车呢
I see you're still forklifting.

100
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:11,840
更像是举着叉子
More like lifting the fork.

101
00:03:12,001 --> 00:03:13,979
哥们 我正想说这笑话呢
Man, I was gonna say that joke!

102
00:03:14,140 --> 00:03:16,880
真抱歉 但我今天得和老婆一起吃午饭
I'm sorry, but I gotta have lunch with my wife today.

103
00:03:17,755 --> 00:03:19,157
我知道 但我必须娶她
I know, baby, but I had to marry her

104
00:03:19,420 --> 00:03:20,720
否则她就拿不到绿卡
so she could stay in the country.

105
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:21,940
不
Oh, no!

106
00:03:21,961 --> 00:03:23,899
我到哪再去找另外一个
Where am I gonna find another husband

107
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:25,640
上班还穿运动裤的老公呀
that wears sweatpants to work?

108
00:03:26,128 --> 00:03:26,932
这是休闲服
Resort wear.

109
00:03:27,420 --> 00:03:28,940
有点太休闲了吧
Maybe last resort.

110
00:03:29,518 --> 00:03:30,387
我很高兴你们来找我吃午饭
Listen, I'm glad you guys step by for lunch,

111
00:03:30,965 --> 00:03:31,013
因为你知道吗
'cause you know what?

112
00:03:31,600 --> 00:03:32,720
我今晚要加班
I got to work a little late tonight.

113
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:35,280
不会吧 你忘了我们今晚的约会啦
No, not tonight. Did you forget our date?

114
00:03:35,980 --> 00:03:38,120
没没 我就是逗你一下
No! No. I was kidding!

115
00:03:38,260 --> 00:03:40,320
我完全不知道她在说什么
I had no idea what she was talking about.

116
00:03:40,380 --> 00:03:41,600
歌洛莉亚 我的神呀
Gloria-god love her --

117
00:03:41,600 --> 00:03:44,420
只要是个纪念日
likes to celebrate every possible milestone

118
00:03:44,420 --> 00:03:45,680
她就都要庆祝一下
in our relationship --

119
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:46,620
我们的邂逅纪念日啊
Day we met...

120
00:03:47,020 --> 00:03:48,060
我们的第一次约会啊
our first date --

121
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:50,300
那次我忘了 我们就大吵了一架
which I forgot, so we got in a big fight.

122
00:03:51,180 --> 00:03:53,560
现在我们还得纪念吵架日
Now we commemorate the big fight.

123
00:03:53,754 --> 00:03:55,626
我们可以情景再现一次
I thought we could re-create the day.

124
00:03:55,820 --> 00:03:58,500
所有事情都按照第一次那天一样
Do everything that we did the first time.

125
00:03:58,560 --> 00:03:59,500
太浪漫了
So romantic.

126
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,580
我也是这么想的
You know, that's exactly what I was thinking.

127
00:04:04,500 --> 00:04:06,960
杰克真好人 他真的很喜欢曼尼
Jack is so nice. I think he really likes Manny.

128
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:08,500
我看他喜欢的是偷懒
What he likes is getting out of work.

129
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:11,580
等等 是曼尼在开吗
Wait a minute. Is that Manny driving?

130
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:12,880
是吗
Is it?

131
00:04:17,167 --> 00:04:18,468
好吧 真是他
Yeah, it's him.

132
00:04:32,116 --> 00:04:36,327
我可怜滴小宝贝 一天去两次医院
Ay, my poor papi. Two doctors in one day.

133
00:04:36,340 --> 00:04:37,260
妈 我没事
Mom, I'm fine.

134
00:04:37,500 --> 00:04:39,180
医生说我已经可以去上学了
The hospital said I could go back to school.

135
00:04:39,340 --> 00:04:41,980
不行 你刚刚经历如此大劫
No, you suffered a traumatic experience.

136
00:04:42,140 --> 00:04:43,480
我都快忘了
I barely remember it!

137
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:45,440
我只记得我把墙撞塌了
I remember crashing through the wall

138
00:04:45,677 --> 00:04:46,943
然后就被救护车送去医院了
and the ambulance ride to the hospital.

139
00:04:47,180 --> 00:04:48,800
没有什么救护车 是我送你去的医院
That wasn't an ambulance. I drove you.

140
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:50,640
-那警笛声哪儿来的 -是你妈在叫
- Then what was that siren? - That was your mother.

141
00:04:50,740 --> 00:04:51,940
偶哪有那么大声
I was not that loud.

142
00:04:52,100 --> 00:04:53,300
亲爱的 别的车都给你让路了
Cars pulled over, honey.

143
00:04:54,380 --> 00:04:55,960
杰 很抱歉把你的墙撞塌了
Jay, I'm sorry about your wall.

144
00:04:56,180 --> 00:04:57,620
不关你的事 是杰克的错
Wasn't your fault, was Jack's,

145
00:04:57,620 --> 00:04:59,100
我已经把他解决了
and I've already taken care of him.

146
00:04:59,260 --> 00:04:59,920
你把他杀啦
You killed him?

147
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,280
在美国杀人犯法
You can't kill people here.

148
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,380
我把他给炒了
I fired him.

149
00:05:02,580 --> 00:05:03,760
但这只是个意外
But it was just an accident!

150
00:05:04,080 --> 00:05:04,980
他又不是故意的
He didn't mean it!

151
00:05:05,186 --> 00:05:06,043
那家伙就是个废物
The guy's a screw-up.

152
00:05:06,260 --> 00:05:07,240
我早该把他炒了
Should have been gone months ago.

153
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:08,760
我们就不能再给他一次机会吗
Can't we just give him another chance?

154
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:09,480
什么"我们"
What is this "we"?

155
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:11,480
跟你们讲
Let me explain something to you people.

156
00:05:11,520 --> 00:05:12,860
在家里 可以说"我们"
Here in this family, it's we.

157
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,440
在工作上 只有"我"
At work, it's me.

158
00:05:14,900 --> 00:05:17,380
我的地盘我做主 说完了
My rules, my decisions...period.

159
00:05:17,380 --> 00:05:18,980
这不公平
That's not fair!

160
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:22,960
你也生我的气吗
You mad at me, too?

161
00:05:23,300 --> 00:05:24,640
米有 你说得对
No. You're right.

162
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:26,560
你的工作你说了算
It's your work.

163
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:29,200
何况 偶也不能你的气
Besides, I can't be mad at you --

164
00:05:29,220 --> 00:05:30,960
因为今天是偶们的特殊日子呀
not on our special day.

165
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:33,480
亲爱的 我在想
Honey, I was thinking --

166
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,820
考虑到曼尼今天的遭遇
with what happened to Manny,

167
00:05:34,880 --> 00:05:37,440
我们还是把我们的纪念日
maybe we better postpone our special day

168
00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:38,520
推到下周末再庆祝吧
until next weekend.

169
00:05:38,980 --> 00:05:41,299
不行 下周末是
No. Next weekend is the anniversary

170
00:05:41,299 --> 00:05:43,921
人家第一次给你做饭的纪念日呀
of the first time that I cooked for you.

171
00:05:49,425 --> 00:05:51,220
干啥呢 感冒小莱尔
What you doin', typhoid Clairey?

172
00:05:51,220 --> 00:05:52,940
你怎么回家来了
Hey. What are you doing home?

173
00:05:53,427 --> 00:05:54,833
你把感冒传染给她了 她就只好回家了
She caught your cold and had to come home.

174
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:56,660
我觉得该把你们俩隔离起来
I thought we should contain you two

175
00:05:56,660 --> 00:05:58,340
省得把全家都传染了
and keep it from spreading through the house.

176
00:05:58,600 --> 00:06:00,380
过来 抱歉啊宝贝
Come here. I'm so sorry.

177
00:06:00,540 --> 00:06:01,240
没事
It's okay.

178
00:06:02,336 --> 00:06:03,804
-手指饼干烤好了没 -还没
- Hey, did you finish my ladyfingers? - Not yet.

179
00:06:04,900 --> 00:06:06,520
-我手机从健身房拿回来了吗 -也没
- Did you pick up my phone from the gym? - Not yet.

180
00:06:06,768 --> 00:06:08,704
是烟雾探测器响吗 我以为你修好了呢
Is that the smoke detector? I thought you fixed that.

181
00:06:08,951 --> 00:06:10,907
天啊 看来你倒是恢复得差不多了
Boy, you're really starting the sound like your own self.

182
00:06:15,340 --> 00:06:17,460
你知道这让我想起什么了吗
You know what this reminds me of?

183
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,160
你小时候
When you were little

184
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:21,510
我们也常常靠在一起看肥皂剧
and we used to snuggle and watch soap operas together.

185
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:22,020
你还记得吗
Remember that?

186
00:06:22,380 --> 00:06:23,300
一点都没变
Nothing's changed.

187
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:25,360
索尼娅还是那人的老婆
Sonya's still married to that guy.

188
00:06:25,534 --> 00:06:27,535
-等等 -那个 谢顶的家伙
- One second. -The one with the...bad hairline.

189
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:29,295
-迪兰 -好 吧
- Dylan? - O...Kay.

190
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:31,040
天呐 我也好想你
God, I miss you, too.

191
00:06:32,940 --> 00:06:35,120
只是感冒啦 小傻瓜
Oh, it's just a cold, silly.

192
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:37,800
你用不着乱想没有我的世界该怎么办
You don't have to conceive of a world without me.

193
00:06:39,615 --> 00:06:42,483
没干吗 我正和我妈躺一起呢
Oh, nothing. I'm just in bed with my mom.

194
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:45,900
少抓狂了 你的梦不会成真的
Stop freaking out. It is not coming true.

195
00:06:52,883 --> 00:06:55,004
沃恩夫人 我是菲尔·邓菲
Uh, Mrs. Vaughn? It's Phil Dunphy.

196
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:56,520
现在是下午三点半
It's about 3:30.

197
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,136
我知道您已经有新的选择了
Now, I know you said you'd moved on,

198
00:06:58,136 --> 00:07:01,455
但是 您很喜欢的那套
but, um, there's been a significant price reduction

199
00:07:01,455 --> 00:07:03,352
在沙利文峡谷的房子
in the, uh, house in Sullivan Canyon,

200
00:07:03,352 --> 00:07:04,713
现在正特价呢
which I know you loved.

201
00:07:04,713 --> 00:07:07,620
所以 如果您能重新考虑一下的话
So, uh, if there's any chance you might reconsider,

202
00:07:07,620 --> 00:07:09,360
绝对不会让您失望的
I know you will not be sorry.

203
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:11,748
我随时恭候您 等您的电话
I can meet you anytime, so just give me a call.

204
00:07:11,748 --> 00:07:14,869
随时 您想在哪里见面都行
Any -- anytime. I can meet you wherever that...

205
00:07:15,162 --> 00:07:17,560
只要是您觉得合适的地方就行
...place is that you feel, uh, that would be best.

206
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:18,600
好吧 谢谢您 再见
Okay, thank you. Bye.

207
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:20,120
老爹
Dad?

208
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:21,840
嘿 小伙子
Hey, buddy!

209
00:07:22,106 --> 00:07:23,474
你好吗 你在干吗
How are ya? W-what are you doin'?

210
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:24,980
防止细菌入侵
Keeping the germs off me.

211
00:07:25,580 --> 00:07:26,620
你啥时候开始爱干净了
You care about germs?

212
00:07:26,700 --> 00:07:28,420
我见过你跟鸽子玩亲亲来着
I've seen you kiss a pigeon on the mouth.

213
00:07:28,660 --> 00:07:30,900
我们班过两天要去迪士尼乐园
My class is going to Disneyland in two days.

214
00:07:31,140 --> 00:07:32,660
不能让老妈把感冒传染给我
I can't get mom's cold.

215
00:07:33,520 --> 00:07:34,240
想法不错
Good plan.

216
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:35,340
我记得这个头盔
I remember this.

217
00:07:35,496 --> 00:07:37,704
我老爸在古巴导弹危机时候买的
My dad bought it during the Cuban missile cisis.

218
00:07:37,860 --> 00:07:40,020
我以前一直没机会戴 也许等一下
I never got a turn in that. You think maybe later I could --

219
00:07:40,020 --> 00:07:40,620
可能吧
Yeah, maybe.

220
00:07:40,740 --> 00:07:42,340
你大下午的怎么会在家
What are you doing home in the afternoon?

221
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:43,640
没啥大不了的
Oh, no big deal.

222
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:45,820
就是几个看房计划泡汤了
Just had a couple of showings fall through.

223
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:47,080
又泡汤了吗
Again?

224
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:48,840
你知道我的口头禅的
You know what I always say.

225
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:49,600
当然
Sure do.

226
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:52,180
不经历风雨 怎能见彩虹
Can't get back on that horse unless you fall off.

227
00:07:52,260 --> 00:07:52,900
对啦
That's right.

228
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:54,660
太大声儿了
That's loud.

229
00:07:54,740 --> 00:07:55,060
抱歉
Sorry.

230
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:58,560
这声音到底是哪儿来的
Where is that coming from?

231
00:07:59,060 --> 00:08:00,740
更换烟雾探测器的电池
Changing the battery in a smoke detector

232
00:08:00,740 --> 00:08:02,400
是男人要掌握的基本技巧
is what they teach you in Man 101,

233
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:04,580
所以说我每次听见这个声音
So, of course, every time I hear that noise,

234
00:08:04,580 --> 00:08:06,780
就像听到了"哔哔 你不是纯爷们儿
all I hear is, "Beep beep -- you're not a man.

235
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:07,960
哔哔 你不是"
Beep beep -- you're not --"

236
00:08:07,960 --> 00:08:08,360
你丫玩儿我吧
Really?!

237
00:08:10,700 --> 00:08:13,080
老爹 能不能帮我开下书包
Hey, dad. Can you open this for me?

238
00:08:13,320 --> 00:08:14,880
没问题 小伙子
Oh. Sure, buddy.

239
00:08:18,440 --> 00:08:19,370
怎么了
What happened?

240
00:08:19,370 --> 00:08:20,775
指甲断了
I broke a nail.

241
00:08:23,340 --> 00:08:24,460
米奇尔 怎么了
Mitchell! What's up?

242
00:08:24,504 --> 00:08:25,432
什么 什么怎么了
What do you -- what do you mean?

243
00:08:25,476 --> 00:08:26,616
你 你刚才发来一条紧急短信
You -- you just sent me an urgent text,

244
00:08:26,660 --> 00:08:27,540
叫我马上过来
saying to come right over.

245
00:08:28,020 --> 00:08:30,240
是我发的 我用了杰的电话
That was from me, I used Jay's phone.

246
00:08:30,500 --> 00:08:31,800
你的脸怎么了
Oh, what happened to your face?

247
00:08:31,980 --> 00:08:33,300
只是一点擦伤
Oh, just a little scrape-up.

248
00:08:33,306 --> 00:08:35,883
米奇尔 我要雇用你为我的朋友杰克
Mitchell, I'd like to engage your legal services

249
00:08:36,140 --> 00:08:37,920
提供法律服务
in representing my friend Jack

250
00:08:37,920 --> 00:08:39,440
起诉他的老板非法解雇
in a wrongful-termination suit.

251
00:08:39,660 --> 00:08:41,000
没门儿 他回不来了
Forget it. He's not coming back.

252
00:08:41,160 --> 00:08:42,480
米奇尔 不要接这个案子
Don't take the case, Mitchell.

253
00:08:42,642 --> 00:08:45,198
我 我没准备接这个案子
I-I don't think I was gonna take the case.

254
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:47,860
好吧 那么基于这种情况
Fine. Then, under the circumstances,

255
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:50,040
我们没什么可谈的了
we have nothing further to talk about.

256
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:52,320
这是我对你说的最后一句话
These will be my last words to you.

257
00:08:52,740 --> 00:08:53,120
敲敲
Knock knock.

258
00:08:53,340 --> 00:08:53,940
是谁
Who's there?

259
00:08:55,560 --> 00:08:56,880
好吧 我被你耍了
Okay, you got me.

260
00:08:57,350 --> 00:08:59,930
你戏弄自己孩子不害臊是吧
I hope you feel clever tricking your kid.

261
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:01,480
米奇 你好吗
Hello, Mitch!

262
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:02,660
歌洛莉亚
Hi, Gloria.

263
00:09:03,980 --> 00:09:04,460
祝贺祝贺
Congratulations!

264
00:09:04,980 --> 00:09:05,780
祝贺什么
On what?

265
00:09:06,220 --> 00:09:07,200
莉莉的拍广告的事
Lily's commercial.

266
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:08,660
不不 我们拒绝了广告商
Oh, no, no. We turned that down.

267
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:09,440
你确定吗
Are you sure?

268
00:09:09,500 --> 00:09:12,300
小卡给我发了一张莉莉在化妆椅上的照片
Because Cam sent me a picture of her in her makeup chair.

269
00:09:12,376 --> 00:09:13,604
不好意思 他干啥了
Uh, sorry. He what?

270
00:09:13,680 --> 00:09:15,240
简直太让人兴奋了
Oh, it's so exciting.

271
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,740
你得记住这一天
You have to remember this day

272
00:09:16,740 --> 00:09:18,920
这样你以后每年都可以庆祝
so that you can celebrate it every year.

273
00:09:21,580 --> 00:09:23,660
好了大伙 我们10分钟以后开拍
Okay, folks, we're about 10 minutes from shooting!

274
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:24,980
明星就位了吗
Is talent ready?

275
00:09:25,348 --> 00:09:26,892
是的 当然了
Yes, uh, she sure is.

276
00:09:27,260 --> 00:09:28,980
听见了吗 莉莉 你是明星了
Did you hear that, Lily? You're the talent.

277
00:09:29,380 --> 00:09:30,740
多神奇呀
Isn't that magical?

278
00:09:31,780 --> 00:09:32,360
葡萄
Grapes.

279
00:09:33,620 --> 00:09:35,300
是道具来着
And that is a prop.

280
00:09:36,327 --> 00:09:37,473
好吧 我们这次真的该挂电话了
Okay, we're really gonna hang up this time.

281
00:09:38,500 --> 00:09:39,440
数到三
On the count of three.

282
00:09:39,520 --> 00:09:39,940
好了吗
Ready?

283
00:09:45,420 --> 00:09:45,900
喂
Hello?

284
00:09:46,860 --> 00:09:48,480
他居然给我挂了
I can't believe he hung up!

285
00:09:48,540 --> 00:09:49,540
我要给他打回去
I'm calling him back.

286
00:09:49,668 --> 00:09:50,980
拿给我
Hey, give me that.

287
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:57,300
天啊 那是杰西吗
Oh, my god. Is that Jesse?

288
00:09:57,980 --> 00:09:59,340
他还没和安吉离婚呢
And he's still married to Angie.

289
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:03,100
给你说点有意思的东西吧
You know something else you might find interesting?

290
00:10:03,773 --> 00:10:05,328
索尼娅现在嗜酒如命
Sonya is drinking,

291
00:10:06,001 --> 00:10:08,227
因为她年轻的时候嫁了个蠢货
because she married a buffoon when she was young,

292
00:10:08,900 --> 00:10:12,600
而她现在意识到她浪费了大好年华
and now she realizes she's wasted her entire life.

293
00:10:13,500 --> 00:10:15,480
你能想象犯那样的错误会怎样吗
Can you imagine making a mistake like that?

294
00:10:16,620 --> 00:10:18,620
当然 那一定 糟透了
Yeah, that must be...horrible.

295
00:10:18,860 --> 00:10:21,780
她现在就是一个怨妇
Yeah, now she's just a bitter ghost of a woman,

296
00:10:21,780 --> 00:10:22,940
心怀愤恨
filled with resentment.

297
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:25,980
你如果不考虑清楚便嫁作他人
But that's what happens when you commit to someone

298
00:10:25,980 --> 00:10:27,900
最后的下场就是这样
before you see what else is out there.

299
00:10:30,160 --> 00:10:30,680
搞什么呀
Seriously?!

300
00:10:31,700 --> 00:10:33,480
她真是已经口不择言了
She couldn't have laid it on thicker.

301
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,880
"怨妇" "十足的蠢货"
"ghost of a woman"? "total buffoon"?

302
00:10:35,920 --> 00:10:37,240
我又不傻
I'm not an idiot.

303
00:10:37,620 --> 00:10:39,500
她就是在说她和我们老爹
She was talking about her and my dad!

304
00:10:39,939 --> 00:10:42,181
可能索尼娅和她老公
Yeah, well, maybe Sonya and her husband

305
00:10:42,620 --> 00:10:44,880
只需要 再努力一点
just need to... work a little harder.

306
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:47,920
他能把青春还给她吗
Can he give her those years back?

307
00:10:48,430 --> 00:10:51,120
她本可以有所作为的
I mean, she could have been something.

308
00:10:51,640 --> 00:10:53,420
她本可以环游世界
She could have traveled the world,

309
00:10:53,820 --> 00:10:55,480
结交一些好男人的
been with fascinating men.

310
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:57,860
还有可能会事业有成
She could have accomplished things.

311
00:10:59,100 --> 00:11:00,940
她现在每次看到他
That's all she thinks about now...

312
00:11:00,940 --> 00:11:07,980
脑子里就只能幻想这些
every time she looks at him.

313
00:11:13,820 --> 00:11:15,180
那不是老妈的围裙吗
Is that mom's apron?

314
00:11:17,040 --> 00:11:19,260
围裙不分男女 都能戴
It's an apron. It's unisex.

315
00:11:19,580 --> 00:11:21,100
很多世界级的大厨可都是男人
Some of the world's greatest chefs are men.

316
00:11:21,438 --> 00:11:22,989
可是这围裙的胸部是突起的
But it's bumped out where the boobs go.

317
00:11:24,681 --> 00:11:25,602
这声音越来越频繁了
That's happening more and more.

318
00:11:25,940 --> 00:11:26,340
没注意
Hadn't noticed.

319
00:11:30,940 --> 00:11:31,580
沃恩夫人
Mrs. Vaughn!

320
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:32,980
感谢你回电
Thanks for calling back.

321
00:11:33,100 --> 00:11:34,020
是的 我正准备
Yeah, I was just about to...

322
00:11:39,123 --> 00:11:40,775
我明白 我怎样才能改变你的
I see. Uh, is there anything I can say that will

323
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:43,947
好吧 非常感谢
All right. Well, thank you very much.

324
00:11:43,947 --> 00:11:47,443
但如果 好吧 再见
And if -- o-okay. Goodbye.

325
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:49,500
又搞砸了一桩生意吗
Did you lose another one?

326
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:52,620
还未得到 又怎能算失去 对吧小子
Hey. Can't lose something you never had, right, pal?

327
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:55,360
那是门铃在响 老爸
That was the doorbell, dad.

328
00:11:55,380 --> 00:11:56,200
我知道
Yeah, I know.

329
00:11:57,500 --> 00:12:00,160
要是人家都不到你这买房子了怎么办
So, what happens if people stop buying houses?

330
00:12:00,160 --> 00:12:02,220
我们是不是要去当童工
Are we all gonna have to get jobs?

331
00:12:02,300 --> 00:12:04,660
只是个小坎而已 没什么大不了的
Just a little slump, buddy. Nothing I can't handle.

332
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:08,240
你好 我是罗恩
Hi, I'm Ron.

333
00:12:08,460 --> 00:12:09,580
我是和克莱尔一起健身的
I work out with Claire at the gym.

334
00:12:09,620 --> 00:12:10,740
快请进
Oh! Yeah. Come on in.

335
00:12:10,988 --> 00:12:12,692
我是来送手机的 她昨天落在健身房了
I brought her phe back. She forgot it yesterday.

336
00:12:12,940 --> 00:12:13,480
太好了 谢谢
Great. Thanks.

337
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:14,472
我是菲尔 克莱尔的老公
I'm phil, Claire's husband.

338
00:12:14,472 --> 00:12:17,144
克莱尔从来没说过她结婚了
Oh. Uh Claire never mentioned she had a husband.

339
00:12:19,740 --> 00:12:21,260
-幸会 -幸会
- Nice to meet you. - You too.

340
00:12:21,290 --> 00:12:23,899
抱歉 我细嫩的手指烧伤了
Oh, sorry! I burnt my ladyfingers.

341
00:12:32,380 --> 00:12:33,420
好安静啊
So quiet.

342
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:36,060
就像教堂里的图书馆
It's like christian "silence" reading room.

343
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:37,160
我挺好的
I'm fine.

344
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:38,460
我也挺好的
So am I.

345
00:12:39,260 --> 00:12:41,820
好吧 俩倔强的小乖乖 我要出门了
Okay, my two stubborn burros. I'm going out.

346
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:43,580
曼尼 你要乖点
Manny, be a good boy.

347
00:12:44,660 --> 00:12:45,180
杰
Jay...

348
00:12:45,674 --> 00:12:45,986
我们待会见
Mm, I'll see you later.

349
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:47,600
你知道去哪找我的
I think you know where.

350
00:12:48,540 --> 00:12:49,060
亲爱的
Honey?

351
00:12:50,220 --> 00:12:51,440
你知道我刚刚在琢磨什么吗
You know what I was just thinking?

352
00:12:52,640 --> 00:12:54,420
人们恋爱时
You know how when people are in love,

353
00:12:54,460 --> 00:12:56,360
有时候会接对方的话茬
sometimes they finish each other's sentences?

354
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:58,660
就像
Like, um...

355
00:12:58,700 --> 00:13:00,140
今晚我们要去
tonight we're going to...

356
00:13:02,180 --> 00:13:03,220
逍遥快活
Have fun!

357
00:13:04,040 --> 00:13:04,360
当然
Yes.

358
00:13:04,980 --> 00:13:06,680
当我们到
When we get to...

359
00:13:06,860 --> 00:13:08,429
一起之后
...gether later!

360
00:13:13,340 --> 00:13:16,180
你根本就不知道你该去哪 没错吧
You have no idea where you're going, do you?

361
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:17,980
-请赐教 -除非把杰克请回来
- Tell me. - Hire Jack back.

362
00:13:18,180 --> 00:13:19,780
-没门 -那你等着遭殃吧
-Forget it. -Your funeral.

363
00:13:21,700 --> 00:13:23,700
莉莉 爸爸就在这
Okay, lily, daddy's gonna be right over here.

364
00:13:24,040 --> 00:13:24,260
别怕哦
Okay.

365
00:13:24,992 --> 00:13:25,868
顺便提一下 这或许或有点帮助
Oh, and, um, by the way, if it helps,

366
00:13:26,600 --> 00:13:28,480
我列了一张单子 上面都是莉莉会做的事
I have a list of things Lily can do.

367
00:13:28,800 --> 00:13:31,777
她会飞吻 还会像鸟一样挥舞双臂
She can blow a kiss, uh, flap her arms like a bird...

368
00:13:31,777 --> 00:13:33,090
谢谢 我会记着的
Thank you. I'll...keep at in mind.

369
00:13:33,090 --> 00:13:34,073
好的 谢谢
Okay. Thank you.

370
00:13:34,073 --> 00:13:35,837
小卡 小卡
Cam. Cam.

371
00:13:35,837 --> 00:13:37,040
你是怎么进来的
How did you get on theet?

372
00:13:37,040 --> 00:13:38,780
当然是走进来的 这里又不是米高梅
I walked on. It's not MGM.

373
00:13:38,900 --> 00:13:40,440
这里只是一个床垫仓库
It's a warehouse behind a mattress store.

374
00:13:41,220 --> 00:13:42,620
我真不敢相信你居然背着我干这事
I can't believe you went behind my back.

375
00:13:42,760 --> 00:13:43,500
我们说好了
We agreed --

376
00:13:43,580 --> 00:13:44,920
我们才没说好呢
We didn't agree on anything.

377
00:13:45,220 --> 00:13:45,920
那是你一厢情愿
You agreed.

378
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:47,640
我们不一定每件事都要达成一致的
We don't have to agree on everything.

379
00:13:47,920 --> 00:13:49,420
我不喜欢你上周买给她的书
I didn't like the book you bought her last week,

380
00:13:49,420 --> 00:13:51,020
可是我也没阻止你读给她听呀
but I didn't stop you from reading it to her.

381
00:13:51,051 --> 00:13:52,229
那书有什么不好的
Well, what was wrong with it?

382
00:13:52,260 --> 00:13:55,160
那对饼干来说怎么会是个大日子 米奇尔
How was it a big day for biscuit, Mitchell? How?

383
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:57,020
好了 我们不是在说饼干的事
Okay, this isn't about biscuit.

384
00:13:57,100 --> 00:13:58,720
我知道 这事关我们的女儿 莉莉
I know. It's about our daughter, Lily.

385
00:13:58,720 --> 00:13:59,640
才不是呢 你想听真话吗
No, you want to know the truth?

386
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:00,640
我认为你这么做是为了自己 小卡
I think it's about you, Cam.

387
00:14:00,780 --> 00:14:01,840
我认为你在利用我们的女儿
I think you're using our daughter

388
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:04,200
来完成你儿时的梦想
to fulfill some childhood dream of yours.

389
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:05,900
好了 家长们
Okay. Parents...

390
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:07,100
我们要开拍了
we're ready to start rolling.

391
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:09,080
我们拍摄的时候
Now, while we're doing the shoot,

392
00:14:09,760 --> 00:14:10,500
吉姆和德布会一旁
Jim and Deb here will be doing

393
00:14:10,950 --> 00:14:11,550
为孩子们配音
the kids' voice-overs into the mike --

394
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:13,380
就好像"猜猜谁在讲话"一样
kind of like "look who's talking".

395
00:14:13,724 --> 00:14:14,956
太好了
Oh. That's great.

396
00:14:15,300 --> 00:14:16,616
这里有太多重要人士了
There are a lot of important people here,

397
00:14:16,616 --> 00:14:17,960
所以我不会在这和你吵
so I'm not gonna get mad,

398
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:20,880
可我对你的那些言外之意感到愤怒
but I resent the implication that I would do anything

399
00:14:20,880 --> 00:14:22,480
你居然说我会做对我们女儿不利的事
that's not in the best interest of our daughter.

400
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:24,900
好了 开始试拍
Okay, let's try a take!

401
00:14:25,460 --> 00:14:26,260
开机
And...action!

402
00:14:26,540 --> 00:14:27,360
噢 不
Oh, no!

403
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:30,900
我们被困在这座家具贼贵的城里了
We are lost in a city of high furniture prices!

404
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:34,880
没人能保护我们不受这些价格的压迫吗
Ohh! Can no one protect us from these high prices?!

405
00:14:35,300 --> 00:14:36,920
切 灯光有问题
Cut! Lighting problem.

406
00:14:37,100 --> 00:14:37,580
稍等一会
One sec.

407
00:14:38,589 --> 00:14:40,026
你随时可以向我道歉
You can apologize to me anytime you're ready.

408
00:14:40,580 --> 00:14:42,300
-你开什么玩笑 -怎么了
- Are you kidding me? - What?

409
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:44,260
这个广告 涉嫌种族歧视
This commercial -- it's a big stereotype.

410
00:14:44,340 --> 00:14:45,300
这叫做反讽
It's called "ironic."

411
00:14:45,580 --> 00:14:47,900
不 难怪莉莉适合拍这个 她是亚裔
No, this is why Lily was perfect -- she's Asian.

412
00:14:47,900 --> 00:14:48,580
她就是个道具
She's a prop.

413
00:14:48,660 --> 00:14:49,900
这叫做天生我材必有用
It's called "niche casting."

414
00:14:49,980 --> 00:14:51,320
别再跟我说这东西叫什么了
Stop telling me what stuff is called!

415
00:14:51,400 --> 00:14:52,900
你简直被聚光灯蒙蔽了双眼
You're so blinded by the spotlight,

416
00:14:52,900 --> 00:14:54,440
你根本看不见这里到底在拍什么
you can't see what's really going on here!

417
00:14:54,820 --> 00:14:55,820
我们再拍一遍
Let's go again!

418
00:14:55,820 --> 00:14:57,200
好了 开始了
All right. Here we go.

419
00:14:57,500 --> 00:14:58,440
大家各就各位 拜托
Let's roll, please!

420
00:14:59,020 --> 00:14:59,580
开拍
Action!

421
00:14:59,820 --> 00:15:02,280
不 我们被困在一座
Oh, no! We are trapped in a city

422
00:15:02,280 --> 00:15:04,080
家具贼贵的城里了
of high furniture prices!

423
00:15:05,040 --> 00:15:07,940
没人能保护我们不受这些价格的压迫吗
Ohh! Can no one protect us from these high prices?!

424
00:15:09,060 --> 00:15:09,780
看啊
Look!

425
00:15:09,780 --> 00:15:10,880
在那儿
Over there!

426
00:15:12,676 --> 00:15:14,960
那是恐龙战队[日本动漫形象]
It's save-zilla!

427
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:17,480
从婴儿围嘴到婴儿床
He's knocking down prices on everything

428
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:19,260
他将每件东西的高价都打倒了
from bibs to cribs!

429
00:15:19,517 --> 00:15:21,074
婴儿游戏床打五折
Half off on playpens!

430
00:15:22,680 --> 00:15:23,490
婴儿高脚椅也在降价
High chairs are low chairs!

431
00:15:23,490 --> 00:15:24,360
对不起 打扰一下
Excuse me. Excuse me.

432
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:27,380
-打扰 打扰 打扰一下 -切
- Excuse me! Excuse me. Excuse me. - Cut!

433
00:15:28,020 --> 00:15:28,820
有什么问题
What's the problem?

434
00:15:29,140 --> 00:15:30,420
你不觉得这支广告
Well, don't you think this commercial

435
00:15:30,420 --> 00:15:32,280
有一丁丁点种族歧视吗
just might be the teeniest bit racist?

436
00:15:32,655 --> 00:15:34,125
我是说 恐龙战队
I mean, um, save-zilla?

437
00:15:34,500 --> 00:15:36,145
这不是种族歧视 这是一种讽刺效果
It's not racist. It's satire.

438
00:15:36,145 --> 00:15:37,060
不是 我懂 但是也许
No, I know, but maybe...

439
00:15:37,060 --> 00:15:38,808
或许语气可以稍微轻一些
maybe we could just tone it down a bit.

440
00:15:38,808 --> 00:15:40,820
或许口音不要那么重
Maybe not hit the accents so hard?

441
00:15:40,820 --> 00:15:42,180
这支广告可是你同意拍的啊
This is the commercial you agreed to.

442
00:15:42,260 --> 00:15:44,360
没错 我知道 我只是
Yeah, well, I know. I just...

443
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:46,380
我不能让我女儿拍这个
I can't let my daughter do this.

444
00:15:46,560 --> 00:15:47,300
我们签了合同的
We had an agreement.

445
00:15:47,760 --> 00:15:49,800
我也请来了本镇最棒的律师
Well, I also have the best attorney town,

446
00:15:49,820 --> 00:15:50,620
放马过来吧
so do your worst.

447
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:51,520
对了 顺便说一下
And by the way,

448
00:15:51,580 --> 00:15:53,720
莉莉是越南人 不是日本人
Lily is vietnamese, not japanese.

449
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:54,920
这其实差别还蛮大的
There's a big difference,

450
00:15:55,060 --> 00:15:55,980
不过你是不会懂的啦
but you wouldn't know that,

451
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:57,780
因为你只想把这些孩子
because you're only interested in seeing these children

452
00:15:57,780 --> 00:15:59,740
作为可轻易替换的模板而已
as interchangeable stereotypes,

453
00:15:59,840 --> 00:16:00,920
你根本没把他们当人看
not human beings.

454
00:16:01,340 --> 00:16:02,000
来吧 莉莉
Come on, Lily.

455
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:03,600
我们走
Let's go.

456
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:04,480
小卡
Cam?

457
00:16:06,061 --> 00:16:06,722
小卡 抱错了
Cam, that's not...

458
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:08,680
你好 小家伙
Hi, buddy.

459
00:16:13,220 --> 00:16:14,200
我们走
There we go.

460
00:16:15,040 --> 00:16:16,460
我去找你妈
Going to meet your mother.

461
00:16:16,980 --> 00:16:18,280
我自己想出答案了
Figured it out all by myself.

462
00:16:19,180 --> 00:16:21,200
两年前 我们刚领完结婚证以后
Two years ago, we got our marriage license,

463
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:22,620
去了一家热狗摊吃热狗
we went to a little hot dog stand.

464
00:16:22,620 --> 00:16:25,040
她说那是她这辈子吃过的
She said was the most romantic meal

465
00:16:25,040 --> 00:16:27,080
最浪漫的一餐
she ever had in her life.

466
00:16:28,060 --> 00:16:29,180
就是这个 对吧
That's it, isn't it?

467
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:31,860
没错 就是这个
Yeah, that's it.

468
00:16:34,075 --> 00:16:35,092
记住这句话
Get this into your head.

469
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:37,220
你可以今后就这么冷漠地对待我
You can give me the cold shoulder the rest of your life.

470
00:16:37,720 --> 00:16:38,660
但是杰克是回不来的了
Jack's not coming back.

471
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:40,660
知道吗 我可以容忍他的游手好闲
See, I could overlook the goofing off,

472
00:16:40,700 --> 00:16:42,340
但你今天很可能会弄得个重伤
but you could have been seriously hurt today.

473
00:16:42,900 --> 00:16:44,480
任何让我的孩子置于险境的人
Anybody puts my kid in danger

474
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:46,780
都不会有第二次机会 永远不会
doesn't get a second chance ever.

475
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:48,900
晚点儿见
I'll see you later.

476
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:52,040
你刚才说我是你的孩子吗
Did you just call me your kid?

477
00:16:53,135 --> 00:16:53,145
我晕
Oh, geez.

478
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,540
你以前从没这么说过
You've never said that before.

479
00:16:55,580 --> 00:16:56,320
我当然说过
Sure I have.

480
00:16:58,260 --> 00:16:59,760
你当然是我的孩子
Well, of course you're my kid.

481
00:16:59,760 --> 00:17:00,540
不然你认为呢
I mean, what do you think?

482
00:17:02,120 --> 00:17:03,800
你去错地方了
You're going to the wrong place.

483
00:17:04,840 --> 00:17:05,120
什么
What?

484
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:06,920
今天跟你们领结婚证无关
It's not your wedding license.

485
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:08,440
-那是什么 -初吻
- What is it? - First kiss.

486
00:17:08,600 --> 00:17:10,120
不可能 你直说吧
No. Just tell me.

487
00:17:10,620 --> 00:17:13,120
我是说 你和我妈的初吻
I mean, your first kiss with my mom.

488
00:17:13,840 --> 00:17:14,880
我的天啊 你说的对
My god, you're right.

489
00:17:15,820 --> 00:17:16,340
多谢啦
Thanks!

490
00:17:20,871 --> 00:17:23,396
-码头 -谢谢
- The pier. - Thanks.

491
00:17:23,763 --> 00:17:25,565
但也许索尼娅并没有做错
But maybe Sonya didn't make a mistake.

492
00:17:25,933 --> 00:17:27,713
也许她是年轻时就遇到了心灵伴侣呢
Maybe she just met her soul mate when she was young.

493
00:17:28,080 --> 00:17:29,920
不不不 这永远不可能发生的
No, no, no. That never happens.

494
00:17:30,180 --> 00:17:31,260
看见没 她曾毅然抛弃自己的人生
See, she threw her life away,

495
00:17:31,280 --> 00:17:32,480
而现在她想要解脱
and now she wants out.

496
00:17:32,760 --> 00:17:33,920
好了 我们别扯这些有的没的了
Okay, let's cut the crap.

497
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:36,020
我们在谈的不是
We're not talking about some character

498
00:17:36,020 --> 00:17:37,640
肥皂剧里的人物 对吧
on a soap opera here, are we?

499
00:17:37,900 --> 00:17:40,500
是 你说的很对
No. No, we're not.

500
00:17:41,700 --> 00:17:42,360
亲爱的 对不起
Honey, I'm sorry.

501
00:17:42,620 --> 00:17:44,840
我不想伤害你的感情 但是
I don't want to hurt your feelings, but...

502
00:17:44,840 --> 00:17:48,200
我已经想了很久了
I've been feeling this way for a really long time,

503
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:51,820
咱俩能彼此坦诚相待吗
and... Can we be honest with each other?

504
00:17:53,100 --> 00:17:54,380
他的确是有点蠢
He's kind of a doofus.

505
00:17:55,020 --> 00:17:56,300
我猜是吧 但是
I guess, but...

506
00:17:56,300 --> 00:17:59,360
我还以为你就喜欢他这点呢
I thought you liked that about him.

507
00:18:01,220 --> 00:18:02,400
不 我从没喜欢过
No, I never did.

508
00:18:03,280 --> 00:18:04,680
相信我 亲爱的
Believe me, honey.

509
00:18:05,010 --> 00:18:07,060
林子里的好鸟多着呢
There are many better options out there.

510
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:07,800
举个例吧
Like who?

511
00:18:08,352 --> 00:18:08,722
我想想
I don't know.

512
00:18:09,274 --> 00:18:09,868
比如说
Off the top of my head, uh...

513
00:18:10,420 --> 00:18:12,600
送披萨的那个帅小伙怎么样
how about that cute guy who delivers the pizzas?

514
00:18:13,080 --> 00:18:14,360
他还没长熟呢
He's like 18!

515
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:15,340
这有什么
So?

516
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:17,100
无视我接着聊
Don't mind me, ladies.

517
00:18:17,100 --> 00:18:18,880
这是最后一个了
This is the last one.

518
00:18:19,260 --> 00:18:20,296
我刚刚做出了一个艰难的决定
I've changed the batteries

519
00:18:20,296 --> 00:18:25,140
给屋子里每一个烟雾报警器都换了电池
In every last smoke detector in the house.

520
00:18:25,140 --> 00:18:25,420
老爸
Hey, dad.

521
00:18:25,860 --> 00:18:28,320
我在网上找到个地方可以卖这风琴
I think I found a place online where I can sell this organ.

522
00:18:28,760 --> 00:18:30,180
你能开车送我去黑市吗
Can you drive me to the black market?

523
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:32,440
黑市上卖的是器官不是风琴[同音多义]
I think they mean a different kind of organ, buddy.

524
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:34,260
宝贝 你为什么想卖掉那个
Sweetie, why are you trying to sell that?

525
00:18:34,360 --> 00:18:36,680
以防老爸的生意继续缩水
In case things with dad's job get even worse.

526
00:18:36,860 --> 00:18:38,640
说真的 我就不懂了
Honestly, I don't know why

527
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:40,040
你们怎么都这么大惊小怪的
everybody's making such a big deal.

528
00:18:40,800 --> 00:18:41,580
我工作好好儿的
Everything's fine.

529
00:18:42,600 --> 00:18:44,060
老天为什么要这样对我
It makes no sense!

530
00:18:44,255 --> 00:18:45,582
我每一个都换过电池啦
I changed every one!

531
00:18:45,777 --> 00:18:46,685
我还是打给我爸好了
I'm gonna call my dad.

532
00:18:46,880 --> 00:18:48,000
不 不准求助他人
No, we're not calling anyone!

533
00:18:48,620 --> 00:18:49,600
我能处理
I can handle this.

534
00:18:50,101 --> 00:18:52,699
只需一根防狼棍即可
I just need the old burglar basher.

535
00:18:53,200 --> 00:18:55,380
这不是你大学时候的拉拉队指挥棒吗
Is that your college cheerleading baton?

536
00:18:56,260 --> 00:18:58,560
是棒子就能用来砸东西
Not when you're on the business end of it.

537
00:19:02,620 --> 00:19:04,900
这下哔不出来了吧
Guess that one won't be chirping anymore, will it?

538
00:19:05,980 --> 00:19:06,460
亲爱滴
Honey...

539
00:19:06,500 --> 00:19:07,360
快去安慰安慰爸
Go after him.

540
00:19:07,700 --> 00:19:09,780
不用 他发泄发泄就好了
Oh, no, he just needs to blow off some steam.

541
00:19:10,460 --> 00:19:11,600
叫你个电池作怪
How's that for battery?!

542
00:19:12,078 --> 00:19:12,782
妈 不管你乐不乐意
Mom, like it or not,

543
00:19:13,260 --> 00:19:14,040
你们曾经海誓山盟过的
you made a commitment,

544
00:19:14,040 --> 00:19:16,280
就算如今这誓言于你如过眼云烟
and maybe that doesn't mean anything to you anymore,

545
00:19:16,280 --> 00:19:19,120
但为了这个家 你有义务挽救你的婚姻
but you owe it to this family to save your marriage

546
00:19:19,120 --> 00:19:21,520
-再努力一回 -神马
- and give it one more try. - What?

547
00:19:22,460 --> 00:19:24,600
末日到了 烟葱哥
End of the line, smokey joe!

548
00:19:24,624 --> 00:19:26,336
爸爸也许是呆了点
Look, dad may be a doofus,

549
00:19:26,360 --> 00:19:30,156
可他远比那个什么披萨幼齿男要好得多了
but he is 10 times better than any pizza-delivery boy.

550
00:19:30,180 --> 00:19:31,260
快去安慰他
Go to him.

551
00:19:31,486 --> 00:19:32,125
你不会以为
Did you --

552
00:19:32,351 --> 00:19:35,074
轮到你冒烟了
I just detected your ass gettin' kicked!

553
00:19:35,300 --> 00:19:35,700
得了
Okay.

554
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:37,940
亲爱的
Honey...

555
00:19:38,420 --> 00:19:39,820
以为能逃过一劫 是吧
Thought I forgot about you, didn't you?

556
00:19:40,180 --> 00:19:40,660
做梦
Nope.

557
00:19:41,270 --> 00:19:41,750
菲尔 打住
Phil, no. Stop.

558
00:19:42,360 --> 00:19:43,440
我不能让它在哔下去了
I gotta stop the damn chirping.

559
00:19:43,539 --> 00:19:45,311
不是响声让你心烦
This isn't about the noise.

560
00:19:45,400 --> 00:19:45,700
小亲亲
Sweetie...

561
00:19:46,760 --> 00:19:48,220
你今天工作不顺心了
...you're having a bad day.

562
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:52,500
我都悲剧这一整个月了
At the end of a bad month.

563
00:19:52,800 --> 00:19:53,480
我懂
I know.

564
00:19:53,800 --> 00:19:55,340
你知道我有多害怕吗 克莱尔
You know how scary that is, Claire?

565
00:19:55,740 --> 00:19:57,700
不 我不知道
No. No, I don't,

566
00:19:57,740 --> 00:19:59,420
因为你从来不告诉我烦心事
because you never tell me the bad stuff.

567
00:19:59,860 --> 00:20:01,540
你只对我说开心事
You only share all the good stuff.

568
00:20:01,800 --> 00:20:03,440
我们不是说好要同甘苦共患难的吗
Honey, what happened to us being a team?

569
00:20:03,747 --> 00:20:05,562
对吧 我们应该相互依靠才对啊
Right? We're supposed to lean on each other.

570
00:20:05,880 --> 00:20:06,400
亲爱的
Honey...

571
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:08,920
我对你充满信心
I have faith in you.

572
00:20:16,103 --> 00:20:17,240
一定是你的感冒害我流鼻涕
I must be catching your cold.

573
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:20,360
好了
Okay.

574
00:20:20,580 --> 00:20:21,520
看开点
You know what?

575
00:20:22,300 --> 00:20:24,280
我们买新的烟雾报警器去
Let's just get new smoke detectors.

576
00:20:24,620 --> 00:20:26,340
我们去年刚换过一次
We already changed them out last year.

577
00:20:26,520 --> 00:20:27,700
记得不 伙计 是你帮我换的
Remember, buddy? You helped me.

578
00:20:27,840 --> 00:20:28,580
当然喽
Sure did.

579
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:31,600
等一下 拆下来的你拿去干吗了
Wait a minute. What'd you do with the old ones?

580
00:20:31,780 --> 00:20:33,460
你叫我拿去扔掉的
You told me to throw them in the garbage,

581
00:20:33,560 --> 00:20:35,680
于是我就拿去阁楼搭了个机器人
so I put them in the attic to make a robot.

582
00:20:35,820 --> 00:20:36,760
是那些旧的在叫
It's the old ones.

583
00:20:37,700 --> 00:20:38,920
电池快用完了
The batteries are dying,

584
00:20:38,920 --> 00:20:40,300
声音是从通风口传进来的
and we can hear them through the vents.

585
00:20:40,360 --> 00:20:41,400
多谢提醒 小子
You did it, buddy!

586
00:20:41,400 --> 00:20:42,200
对不起晃到你了
I'm sorry.

587
00:20:45,100 --> 00:20:45,940
我爱你
I love you.

588
00:20:46,020 --> 00:20:46,780
我爱你
I love you.

589
00:20:51,040 --> 00:20:52,460
那是我的功劳
I did that.

590
00:21:01,566 --> 00:21:03,092
准是我订的披萨到了
Oh. That must be the pizza I ordered.

591
00:21:03,900 --> 00:21:04,680
披萨 你叫披萨了
Pizza? You ordered pizza?

592
00:21:05,320 --> 00:21:07,180
对啊 心血来潮想吃披萨
Yeah. I was just sort of in the mood, you know?

593
00:21:08,140 --> 00:21:09,900
我们前几天刚吃过呀
But we had pizza a couple nights ago.

594
00:21:10,420 --> 00:21:11,560
我知道 但我就是想吃
I know, but I had an urge,

595
00:21:11,692 --> 00:21:12,968
心动不如行动嘛
and when you get an urge, you get an urge.

596
00:21:13,100 --> 00:21:14,120
给我 我去付钱
Okay, here, I'll get it!

597
00:21:14,358 --> 00:21:15,232
没事 宝贝 我去就行了
No, sweetie, I've got it.

598
00:21:15,480 --> 00:21:17,120
不 妈 你总叫我做点力所能及的事
No, mom. You're always asking me to do things.

599
00:21:17,180 --> 00:21:18,640
让我去 你坐好等着吃
I'll get it. Here, just sit back, relax.

600
00:21:18,856 --> 00:21:19,503
我去拿披萨 别担心
I'll get the pizza. Don't worry.

601
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:20,397
我 我 真是 好吧 记得找零
I-I...really -- okay, get the change.

602
00:21:24,860 --> 00:21:25,160
拿去
Here!

603
00:21:26,100 --> 00:21:28,240
你再往我们家送披萨 我打断你的腿
And I think it's best you don't come around here anymore!
